#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-landing-page.rst:7
#: c46baf9373814f33aa2f5d4c0acf9955
msgid ""
"Sub has a number of failsafe mechanisms to ease vehicle recovery/prevent "
"wandering in the event that vehicle control is lost. The main failsafe "
"topics are listed below."
msgstr "水下机器人具有多种故障保护机制，在飞行器失控时便于恢复/防止漂移。主要故障保护主题如下所列。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-landing-page.rst:9
#: e49256ac4b5743c3aae08de258dda0c5
msgid ""
"Once a Radio Failsafe, Battery Failsafe, GCS Failsafe or Pilot Control Loss "
"Failsafe is entered and the failsafe action taken involves a mode change to "
"the vehicle, it will remain in that mode until the pilot changes the mode "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"一旦触发无线电故障保护、电池故障保护、地面站故障保护或飞手控制丢失故障保护，且故障保护动作涉及飞行器模式切换，飞行器将保持在该模式，直到飞手直接更改模式。"
